  "description": "BIGGER BATTERY LIFE - Adventures are extended on the Glide Pro. This hoverboard boasts a 36V 2.6aH, giving riders a max range of 5 miles.\n\nMORE POWER - GOTRAX continues to deliver unique high performance hoverboards. The Glide Pro features Dual 200 Watt Motors & a max speed of 6.2MPH\n\nONE-OF-A-KIND DESIGN - The Glide Pro is our most unique hoverboard with chrome paint finish and infinity light wheels.\n\nBLUETOOTH SPEAKERS - With integrated bluetooth speakers, the GOTRAX Glide Pro lets you take your music with you.\n\nUNIQUE GIFT FOR EVERYONE - This hoverboard isn’t just for kids! It can be a thoughtful and unique gift for your friends and family. It's a fun surprise and can carry riders of all sizes up to 220 lbs/ 99.7KG\n\n5 Miles per Charge\n6.2 MPH Max Speed\n400W Avg. Power (Dual 200W Motors)",
